                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course aims to help junior dental students familiarize themselves with the clinical working environment and workflow in advance, and cultivate basic dental medical thinking and operational skills. Through theoretical explanations, simulation training and clinical observation, students will learn oral examination, diagnosis of common diseases and basic treatment procedures. The course emphasizes the combination of practice and theory, laying a solid foundation for subsequent professional studies.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
